><th><code><b>_revinclude</b></code></th><th><b>Operations</b></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href="#Observation1-1">Observation</a></td><td><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/vitalsigns.html">http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/vitalsigns</a><br/><em>Additional supported profiles:</em><br/>  <a href="StructureDefinition-DIPSVitalSignsObservationBloodpressure.html">DIPS Vital Signs Observation - Blood Pressure</a><br/>  <a href="StructureDefinition-DIPSVitalSignsObservationBodyHeight.html">DIPS Vital Signs Observation - Body Height</a><br/>  <a href="StructureDefinition-DIPSVitalSignsObservationBodyMassIndex.html">DIPS Vital Signs Observation - Body Mass Index(BMI)</a><br/>  <a href="StructureDefinition-DIPSVitalSignsObservationConsciousness.html">DIPS Vital Signs Observation - Level of Consciousness</a><br/>  <a href="StructureDefinition-DIPSVitalSignsObservationNews2Score.html">DIPS Vital Signs Observation - NEWS2</a><br/>  <a href="StructureDefinition-DIPSVitalSignsObservationBodyWeight.html">DIPS Vital Signs Observation - Body Weight</a><br/>  <a href="StructureDefinition-DIPSVitalSignsObservationHeartRate.html">DIPS Vital Signs Observation - Heart Rate</a><br/>  <a href="StructureDefinition-DIPSVitalSignsObservationOxygenSaturation.html">DIPS Vital Signs Observation - Oxygen Saturation</a><br/>  <a href="StructureDefinition-DIPSVitalSignsObservationRespirationRate.html">DIPS Vital Signs Observation - Respiration Rate</a><br/>  <a href="https://hl7.no/fhir/no-domain/vitalsigns/StructureDefinition-no-domain-VitalSigns-Observation-bodyheight.html">no-domain-VitalSigns-Observation-bodyheight Profile</a><br/>  <a href="https://hl7.no/fhir/no-domain/vitalsigns/StructureDefinition-no-domain-VitalSigns-Observation-bodytemp.html">no-domain-VitalSigns-Observation-bodytemp Profile</a><br/>  <a href="https://hl7.no/fhir/no-domain/vitalsigns/StructureDefinition-no-domain-VitalSigns-Observation-bodyweight.html">no-domain-VitalSigns-Observation-bodyweight Profile</a><br/