tion.html">no-domain-VitalSigns-Observation-oxygensaturation Profile</a><br/><a href="https://hl7.no/fhir/no-domain/vitalsigns/StructureDefinition-no-domain-VitalSigns-Observation-respirationrate.html">no-domain-VitalSigns-Observation-respirationrate Profile</a><br/><a href="https://hl7.no/fhir/no-domain/vitalsigns/StructureDefinition-no-domain-VitalSigns-Observation-pulse.html">no-domain-VitalSigns-Observation-pulse Profile</a></p></div><div class="col-lg-6"><span class="lead">Interaction summary</span><br/><ul><li>Supports <br/><code>create</code><div><p>Register an observation on a specific patient in DIPS.
It is not  possible to register cancer and person injury
diagnoses via this interface.</p>
</div><code>read</code><div><p>Read an observation by fhir id returned by the service</p>
</div><code>search-type</code><div><p>Fetch observations by patient, fhirid, code, externalfhirid and effectivedatetime</p>
</div></li></ul></div></div><p/><div class="row"><div class="col-lg-7"><span class="lead">Search Parameters</span><table class="table table-condensed table-hover"><thead><tr><th>Conformance</th><th>Parameter</th><th>Type</th><th>Documentation</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>fhirid</td><td><code>reference</code></td><td><div><p>DIPS fhir id</p>
